-    -   Linear Index: $faceId = c \times 6 + f$.
-    -   Texel Coordinates:
-        -   $col = faceId \pmod{W_s}$
-        -   $row = \lfloor faceId / W_s \rfloor$
-    -   Value:
-        -   `cellScalarTex[row * W_s + col]` = $cellScalarAvg$.
